### **4. Teaching the Beast (Agent Skills)**

The final part of your first step is teaching the AI your specific rules so you don't have to repeat prompts [24, 25].

* **Create a .md Skill File:** Create a folder named `agent.skills` and add a file called `skill.md` [26, 27].
* **Define Your Standards:** Write down exactly how you want tasks performed—such as your brand voice, specific design rules (like using **UI Pro Max** for high-end design), or business logic [18, 28, 29]. The AI will reference this "instruction manual" forever [25, 30]

